OL,3,GNEWSARepair scheme set to start on ring
OL,4,Aroad route
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs to Leeds Inner Ring Road's
OL,7,Fretaining walls are set to begin as
OL,8,Fpart of a long-term scheme to maintain
OL,9,Fone of the city's busiest routes.
OL,11,FLeeds City Council said overnight work
OL,12,Fwould take place between Woodhouse
OL,13,FTunnel and Woodhouse Lane from Tuesday
OL,14,Fand was expected to last about 15
OL,15,Fweeks.
OL,17,FThe local authority said the project
OL,18,Fwas the first phase of a wider
OL,19,Fstructural maintenance programme, with
OL,20,Fwork carried out between 19:00 and
OL,21,F05:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
