OL,3,GNEWSARepair scheme set to start on ring
OL,4,Aroad route
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Peter Carlill, the
OL,7,Fauthority's executive member for
OL,8,Ftransport and planning, said: "Many of
OL,9,Fthe structures supporting the route
OL,10,Fwere built decades ago and now require
OL,11,Finvestment to ensure they remain safe
OL,12,Fand reliable for the future."
